{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49925","headline":"沁园春 一 · 吕岩","name":"沁园春 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"七返还丹，在我先须，炼已待时。\n正一阳初动，中宵漏永。\n温温铅鼎，光透帘帏。\n造化争驰，虎龙交媾，进火功夫牛斗危。\n曲江上，看月华莹净，有个乌飞。\n当时，自饮刀圭，又谁信无中就养儿。\n辨水源清浊，木金间隔。\n不因师指，此事难知。\n道要玄微，天机深远，下手忙修犹太迟。\n蓬莱路，待三千行满，独步云归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}